# Environment
# .env contains release/dev tooling secrets (Sentry, Sparkle, Notarization).
# .env.app.dev contains local dev overrides with real model API keys (Gemini, ElevenLabs).
# .env.app itself is INTENTIONALLY TRACKED — see the file's header. It holds only
# public bootstrap identifiers (Firebase API key, OAuth client ID, Cloud Run URL,
# GCP project metadata). Real model API keys are fetched at runtime via KeyService
# and never ship in any binary.
.env
.env.app.dev

